{
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "$schema": "https://docs.oasis-open.org/sarif/sarif/v2.1.0/errata01/os/schemas/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "grype",
          "version": "0.99.1",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "ELSA-2024-12364-gnutls",
              "name": "RpmMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "ELSA-2024-12364 medium vulnerability for gnutls package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "[3.8.3-4_fips]\n- Add FIPS package change: add fips suffix to Release and\n  set Epoch to 10 [Orabug: 35925409]\n- Update FIPS module name for Oracle Linux [Orabug: 35925409]\n\n[3.8.3-4]\n- Bump release to ensure el9 package is greater than el9_* packages\n\n[3.8.3-3]\n- Bump release to ensure el9 package is greater than el9_* packages\n\n[3.8.3-2]\n- Fix timing side-channel in deterministic ECDSA (RHEL-28959)\n- Fix potential crash during chain building/verification (RHEL-28954)\n\n[3.8.3-1]\n- Update to gnutls 3.8.3 (RHEL-14891)\n\n[3.8.2-3]\n- Skip KTLS test exercising ChaCha20-Poly1305 in TLS 1.3 as well (RHEL-18498)\n\n[3.8.2-2]\n- Bump nettle dependency to 3.9.1\n- Skip KTLS test exercising ChaCha20-Poly1305 in TLS 1.2 (RHEL-18498)\n\n[3.8.2-1]\n- Update to gnutls 3.8.2 (RHEL-14891)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability ELSA-2024-12364\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: gnutls\nVersion: 3.8.3-6.el9\nFix Version: 10:3.8.3-4.el9_4_fips\nType: rpm\nLocation: /var/lib/rpm/rpmdb.sqlite\nData Namespace: oracle:distro:oraclelinux:9\nLink: [ELSA-2024-12364](https://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2024-12364.html)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability ELSA-2024-12364**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | gnutls  | 3.8.3-6.el9  | 10:3.8.3-4.el9_4_fips  | rpm  | /var/lib/rpm/rpmdb.sqlite  | oracle:distro:oraclelinux:9  | [ELSA-2024-12364](https://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2024-12364.html)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:rpm/ol/gnutls@3.8.3-6.el9?arch=x86_64\u0026distro=ol-9.6\u0026upstream=gnutls-3.8.3-6.el9.src.rpm"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.3"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ELSA-2024-12336-gnutls",
              "name": "RpmMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "ELSA-2024-12336 medium vulnerability for gnutls package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "[3.7.6-23.4_fips]\n- Add FIPS package change: add fips suffix to Release and\n  set Epoch to 10 [Orabug: 35925409]\n- Update FIPS module name for Oracle Linux [Orabug: 35925409]\n- Verify salt length and iteration count for PBKDF [Orabug: 35925409]\n\n[3.7.6-23.4]\n- Fix timing side-channel in deterministic ECDSA (RHEL-28958)\n- Fix potential crash during chain building/verification (RHEL-28953)\n\n[3.7.6-23.3]\n- x509: detect loop in certificate chain (RHEL-21759)\n- fips: Zeroize temporary values in integrity check (RHEL-21870)\n\n[3.7.6-23.2]\n- auth/rsa_psk: minimize branching after decryption\n\n[3.7.6-23.1]\n- auth/rsa_psk: side-step potential side-channel (RHEL-16755)\n\n[3.7.6-23]\n- Mark SHA-1 signature verification non-approved in FIPS (#2102751)\n\n[3.7.6-22]\n- Skip KTLS test on old kernel if host and target arches are different"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability ELSA-2024-12336\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: gnutls\nVersion: 3.8.3-6.el9\nFix Version: 10:3.7.6-23.el9_3.4_fips\nType: rpm\nLocation: /var/lib/rpm/rpmdb.sqlite\nData Namespace: oracle:distro:oraclelinux:9\nLink: [ELSA-2024-12336](https://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2024-12336.html)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability ELSA-2024-12336**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | gnutls  | 3.8.3-6.el9  | 10:3.7.6-23.el9_3.4_fips  | rpm  | /var/lib/rpm/rpmdb.sqlite  | oracle:distro:oraclelinux:9  | [ELSA-2024-12336](https://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2024-12336.html)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:rpm/ol/gnutls@3.8.3-6.el9?arch=x86_64\u0026distro=ol-9.6\u0026upstream=gnutls-3.8.3-6.el9.src.rpm"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ELSA-2024-12675-openssl",
              "name": "RpmMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "ELSA-2024-12675 medium vulnerability for openssl package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "[3.0.7-28.0.1_fips]\n- Replace upstream references in fips man pages [Orabug: 35824276]\n- Add FIPS package change: add fips suffix to Release and\n  set Epoch to 10 [Orabug: 35824276]\n- Update FIPS module name and remove upstream references from\n  fips_module_indicators manpage [Orabug: 35824276]\n\n[3.0.7-28.0.1]\n- Drop OpenELA branding, apply Oracle branding patches\n- Enable openssl-fips-provider dependency [Orabug: 36504822]\n- Temporary disable openssl-fips-provider dependency [Orabug: 36504822]\n- Replace upstream references [Orabug: 34340177]\n\n[1:3.0.7-28]\n- Patch for CVE-2024-6119\n  Resolves: RHEL-55340"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability ELSA-2024-12675\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: openssl\nVersion: 1:3.2.2-6.0.1.el9_5.1\nFix Version: 10:3.0.7-28.0.1.el9_4_fips\nType: rpm\nLocation: /var/lib/rpm/rpmdb.sqlite\nData Namespace: oracle:distro:oraclelinux:9\nLink: [ELSA-2024-12675](https://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2024-12675.html)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability ELSA-2024-12675**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | openssl  | 1:3.2.2-6.0.1.el9_5.1  | 10:3.0.7-28.0.1.el9_4_fips  | rpm  | /var/lib/rpm/rpmdb.sqlite  | oracle:distro:oraclelinux:9  | [ELSA-2024-12675](https://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2024-12675.html)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:rpm/ol/openssl@3.2.2-6.0.1.el9_5.1?arch=x86_64\u0026distro=ol-9.6\u0026epoch=1\u0026upstream=openssl-3.2.2-6.0.1.el9_5.1.src.rpm"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ELSA-2024-12675-openssl-libs",
              "name": "RpmMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "ELSA-2024-12675 medium vulnerability for openssl-libs package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "[3.0.7-28.0.1_fips]\n- Replace upstream references in fips man pages [Orabug: 35824276]\n- Add FIPS package change: add fips suffix to Release and\n  set Epoch to 10 [Orabug: 35824276]\n- Update FIPS module name and remove upstream references from\n  fips_module_indicators manpage [Orabug: 35824276]\n\n[3.0.7-28.0.1]\n- Drop OpenELA branding, apply Oracle branding patches\n- Enable openssl-fips-provider dependency [Orabug: 36504822]\n- Temporary disable openssl-fips-provider dependency [Orabug: 36504822]\n- Replace upstream references [Orabug: 34340177]\n\n[1:3.0.7-28]\n- Patch for CVE-2024-6119\n  Resolves: RHEL-55340"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability ELSA-2024-12675\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: openssl-libs\nVersion: 1:3.2.2-6.0.1.el9_5.1\nFix Version: 10:3.0.7-28.0.1.el9_4_fips\nType: rpm\nLocation: /var/lib/rpm/rpmdb.sqlite\nData Namespace: oracle:distro:oraclelinux:9\nLink: [ELSA-2024-12675](https://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2024-12675.html)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability ELSA-2024-12675**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | openssl-libs  | 1:3.2.2-6.0.1.el9_5.1  | 10:3.0.7-28.0.1.el9_4_fips  | rpm  | /var/lib/rpm/rpmdb.sqlite  | oracle:distro:oraclelinux:9  | [ELSA-2024-12675](https://linux.oracle.com/errata/ELSA-2024-12675.html)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:rpm/ol/openssl-libs@3.2.2-6.0.1.el9_5.1?arch=x86_64\u0026distro=ol-9.6\u0026epoch=1\u0026upstream=openssl-3.2.2-6.0.1.el9_5.1.src.rpm"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "GHSA-5rjg-fvgr-3xxf-setuptools",
              "name": "PythonMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "GHSA-5rjg-fvgr-3xxf high vulnerability for setuptools package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "setuptools has a path traversal vulnerability in PackageIndex.download that leads to Arbitrary File Write"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability GHSA-5rjg-fvgr-3xxf\nSeverity: high\nPackage: setuptools\nVersion: 73.0.1\nFix Version: 78.1.1\nType: python\nLocation: /usr/lib/mysqlsh/lib/python3.13/site-packages/setuptools-73.0.1.dist-info/METADATA\nData Namespace: github:language:python\nLink: [GHSA-5rjg-fvgr-3xxf](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-5rjg-fvgr-3xxf)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability GHSA-5rjg-fvgr-3xxf**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | setuptools  | 73.0.1  | 78.1.1  | python  | /usr/lib/mysqlsh/lib/python3.13/site-packages/setuptools-73.0.1.dist-info/METADATA  | github:language:python  | [GHSA-5rjg-fvgr-3xxf](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-5rjg-fvgr-3xxf)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:pypi/setuptools@73.0.1"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.8"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
